# Metadata helpers

## Use shared builders

- Root layout: `buildRootMetadata()` (`metadataBase`, title template, default robots).
- Each public page: `buildPageMetadata({ title, description, path, ogImage?, noIndex? })`.
- Build absolute URLs with `absoluteUrl` / `getSiteUrl()` — do not concatenate `site` host ad hoc.

## Canonical and home

- Home canonical includes trailing slash: `` `${absoluteUrl(paths.home)}/` ``.
- Home title may use `{ absolute: title }` when the full title is already brand-complete.
- Non-home titles use `| ${site.name}` via the shared formatter / template.

## OG / Twitter

- Set `openGraph.locale` from `site.ogLocale`, `siteName`, absolute image (default `site.defaultOgImage`).
- Twitter: `summary_large_image` with the same title/description/image.

## Sitemap / robots

- Prefer `getSiteUrl()` for sitemap and robots `sitemap` URL.
- Home sitemap entry should use trailing `/` to match canonical.
